    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούλ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>willing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				433a43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἀγαθοῦ ὄρεξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Top.</u>
					146b5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1111b19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀδυνάτων, τοῦ
			τέλους</span>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				1111b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1113a15
			</span></i>; <i>purpose</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσσειν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					1305
				</span></i>
			; <i>wish, desire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				509d
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούλησιν ἐλπίζει</span>
			entertains a hope and <i>purpose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.78
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					420d
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τὴν β.</span> ibid.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1136b24
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				688b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1378b18
			</span></i>; of the gods, <i><span class="en">
				Polystr.
				p.10
			</span></i> W. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>purpose</i> or <i>meaning</i> of a poem, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				344b
			</span></i>; <i>signification</i> of a word, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				421b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>will, testament</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἔγγραφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLips.</u>
					33 ii 10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>.</div>
